Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:18:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 41/52] Level cap: clamp Exp, Day Care and candy messages

Battle Exp is clamped so a Pokemon below the cap can't overshoot it in
one award, the Day Cares stop at the cap, and Rare/Special Candy at the
cap says so instead of 'It won't have any effect'.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
